  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Tuberculosis is a bacterial infection caused by the bacteria Mycobacterium
    tuberculosis. Tuberculosis can spread through the bloodstream and reach other
    parts of the body such as the brain according to the CDC. This illness is spread
    via airborne droplets from infected people coughing and sneezing. It can also
    be spread by sharing food and drink or spending extended periods of time with
